-- **A base that publishes the object language it is written against** (MS11
-- phase 289, his ruling of 2026-10-30 — `04-taking-terms-apart.thena.rules`
-- needing `LC`): whoever consults it may name what `Bit` declares.
rule base speaks where

public import test.modules.Bit

rule bitly :- do
  say "bit"
